        <mxCell id="Bn109" value="Known conversation -&gt; append as an update and skip the intent gate. New -&gt; create case + correlation ID (FR1)." style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;rounded=0;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b3b3b3;fontSize=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1380" y="1603" width="700" height="92" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Bn110" value="READ / WRITE BOUNDARY:  P1-P17 are all reads. Ariba, SAP S/4, SPVR, BIVS and the PA Allocation List are never written to - US-18 states the PO must not be
modified automatically, and FR3 grants write access only to the group mailbox and the case store. Consequence (N-29): when a draft asks a PA or BP to correct
a PO or approve a receipt, nothing in the solution observes that it happened. The only return channel is a reply landing back in the group mailbox." style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b85450;dashed=1;fontColor=#b85450;fontStyle=2;fontSize=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="1715" width="2140" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
